  "solution": {
    "brief": "Wasp example 17: field-driven series continued",
    "principle": "\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 18 (wasp_18) directly continues the field-driven series from tutorial 17, further developing scalar-field-driven aggregation with biased-growth, isoline techniques, and parametric-growth strategies. Tutorial 17 is a direct prerequisite for tutorial 18, and the two share closely related content around field-driven discrete assembly with attribute-based, custom-preview, and 3d-populate workflows.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 19 (wasp_19) continues the field-driven series beyond tutorial 18, confirming the series extends through at least tutorial 19. Tutorial 17 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 19 via tutorial 18.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 20 (wasp_20) continues the field-driven series beyond tutorial 19, confirming the series extends through at least tutorial 20. Tutorial 17 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 20 via tutorials 18 and 19.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 21 (wasp_21) continues beyond tutorial 20 into a new topic series, confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 17 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 21 via tutorials 18, 19, and 20.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 23 (wasp_23) continues the new topic series beyond tutorial 22, further confirming the field-driven series concludes at tutorial 20. Tutorial 17 is an indirect prerequisite for tutorial 23 via tutorials 18, 19, 20, 21, 22.",
